### Create a purchase
POST http://localhost:5293/api/purchases
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productName": "Samsung Galaxy S25",
  "retailer": "Samsung Store",
  "purchaseDate": "2026-11-08T00:00:00",
  "purchasePrice": 15999.99,
  "warrantyDurationMonths": 24
}

### Get all active purchases
GET http://localhost:5293/api/purchases/1
Accept: application/json


### Restore an archived purchase
PATCH http://localhost:5293/api/purchases/2/restore

### Get archived purchases
GET http://localhost:5293/api/purchases/archived
Accept: application/json


### Archive a purchase
PATCH http://localhost:5293/api/purchases/9/archive